    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35896" root="قطر" body-key="q">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استقطرهُ</span></b>  <i>He sought,</i> or <i>desired, its dropping,</i>
or <i>dripping,</i> or <i>flowing;</i> [<i>endeavoured to make it
drop,</i> or <i>drip;</i>] expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَامَ قَطَرَانَهُ</span>, (K, TA,) i. e.,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيَلَانَهُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استقطر مَعْرُوفًا</span> [<i>He sought,</i>
or <i>demanded, bounty, as it were drop by drop</i>].
(K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نض</span>.)

